# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# itoolbox-web
# Copy to .env.local. Never commit the filled copy.
#
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* values belong here. They ship to the browser, so no secret
# (API keys, JWT secret, Zetaris credentials) may ever appear in this repo — they
# live in itoolbox-backend.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# The API, as the BROWSER reaches it. Unset, the app uses the scheme and host
# that served the page, on port 8100. For a dev server against the host's API over
# Tailscale, set https://itoolbox.taildc9975.ts.net:8100.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8100

# ── Contract generation ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Directory holding the backend's committed OpenAPI schema. Defaults to a
# sibling itoolbox-backend checkout; override if yours lives elsewhere.
#   npm run gen:types
ITOOLBOX_CONTRACT_DIR=../itoolbox-backend/contract
